{
  "passed": true,
  "narration": [
    {
      "id": "T1",
      "text": "The Trojan horse is",
      "frame": 48,
      "ratio": 8.132673631859692
    },
    {
      "id": "T1",
      "text": "not in the Iliad.",
      "frame": 48,
      "ratio": 7.654564673157545
    },
    {
      "id": "T1",
      "text": "Homer's Iliad ends before",
      "frame": 156,
      "ratio": 7.971395641732056
    },
    {
      "id": "T1",
      "text": "the horse is even built.",
      "frame": 156,
      "ratio": 7.197155441604175
    },
    {
      "id": "T1",
      "text": "In one old translation,",
      "frame": 274,
      "ratio": 13.902188459309045
    },
    {
      "id": "T1",
      "text": "its last line reads:",
      "frame": 274,
      "ratio": 14.099080586636871
    },
    {
      "id": "T1",
      "text": "\"Thus held they funeral for",
      "frame": 389,
      "ratio": 12.926016563760182
    },
    {
      "id": "T1",
      "text": "Hector tamer of horses.\"",
      "frame": 389,
      "ratio": 12.597252147580662
    },
    {
      "id": "T1",
      "text": "The wooden horse appears",
      "frame": 494,
      "ratio": 14.852858810468458
    },
    {
      "id": "T1",
      "text": "later, in the Odyssey.",
      "frame": 494,
      "ratio": 15.404017200108477
    },
    {
      "id": "T2",
      "text": "This is one of",
      "frame": 36,
      "ratio": 7.088175450178064
    },
    {
      "id": "T2",
      "text": "the oldest known pictures",
      "frame": 36,
      "ratio": 7.2719220319314255
    },
    {
      "id": "T2",
      "text": "of the Trojan horse.",
      "frame": 101,
      "ratio": 6.692051304740421
    },
    {
      "id": "T2",
      "text": "It is on a",
      "frame": 156,
      "ratio": 6.819639410982844
    },
    {
      "id": "T2",
      "text": "clay jar from the",
      "frame": 156,
      "ratio": 6.615358709238765
    },
    {
      "id": "T2",
      "text": "Greek island of Mykonos,",
      "frame": 215,
      "ratio": 7.164453933510317
    },
    {
      "id": "T2",
      "text": "made around 670 BC.",
      "frame": 297,
      "ratio": 8.231433335413367
    },
    {
      "id": "T2",
      "text": "The horse stands on wheels.",
      "frame": 377,
      "ratio": 7.0563979277799
    },
    {
      "id": "T2",
      "text": "And in its side,",
      "frame": 430,
      "ratio": 7.064783908476454
    },
    {
      "id": "T2",
      "text": "small windows show the faces",
      "frame": 481,
      "ratio": 6.901076849131032
    },
    {
      "id": "T2",
      "text": "of warriors hidden inside.",
      "frame": 541,
      "ratio": 6.832168147836839
    },
    {
      "id": "T3",
      "text": "\"I fear the Grecians even",
      "frame": 56,
      "ratio": 6.963500309382886
    },
    {
      "id": "T3",
      "text": "when they offer gifts.\"",
      "frame": 56,
      "ratio": 7.029554864760125
    },
    {
      "id": "T3",
      "text": "This famous warning",
      "frame": 160,
      "ratio": 13.745642698577829
    },
    {
      "id": "T3",
      "text": "is not from Homer.",
      "frame": 160,
      "ratio": 13.72247257368443
    },
    {
      "id": "T3",
      "text": "It comes from Virgil's Aeneid,",
      "frame": 238,
      "ratio": 12.832123961514998
    },
    {
      "id": "T3",
      "text": "written about two",
      "frame": 314,
      "ratio": 12.966237281274715
    },
    {
      "id": "T3",
      "text": "thousand years ago.",
      "frame": 314,
      "ratio": 13.10522711112004
    },
    {
      "id": "T3",
      "text": "There, the Trojan priest",
      "frame": 413,
      "ratio": 14.76388126245692
    },
    {
      "id": "T3",
      "text": "Laocoön says it, and",
      "frame": 413,
      "ratio": 14.786630554850307
    },
    {
      "id": "T3",
      "text": "then hurls his spear",
      "frame": 508,
      "ratio": 11.828203030808059
    },
    {
      "id": "T3",
      "text": "at the wooden horse.",
      "frame": 508,
      "ratio": 14.158059383311366
    }
  ],
